      <div type="layout" source="#source-358-419" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-379-415"><seg source="#source-379-382">一</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-419-460"><seg source="#source-419-425">我が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-425-437"><rb>肢</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-437-460">は甘くたるみて</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-460-507"><seg source="#source-460-466">痛む</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466-484"><rb>頭</rb><rt>かしら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-484-507">もこゝろよし、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-507-554"><seg source="#source-507-554">この頭くらく、めくるめくとき、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-554-591"><seg source="#source-554-591">失ひし楽園は幻に見ゆ。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-591-652" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-612-648"><seg source="#source-612-615">二</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-652-690"><seg source="#source-652-690">手はふるひ、足はよろめく</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-690-722"><seg source="#source-690-722">さながら、酔ひどれが</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-722-757"><seg source="#source-722-757">家路へかへるにも似て、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-757-794"><seg source="#source-757-794">地獄の門に倒れ入らん。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-794-855" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-815-851"><seg source="#source-815-818">三</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-855-905"><seg source="#source-855-905">滅びよ、滅びよ、いとしき我が身、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-905-949"><seg source="#source-905-949">急げよ、たのしき地獄の門へ。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-949-987"><seg source="#source-949-987">すべてのものゝ存在せざる</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-987-1047"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-987-1005"><rb>其処</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1005-1047">にこそ我が失ひし楽園はあれ。</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
